# Client-side routing fallback for Cloudflare Pages.
#
# The site uses react-router, so /rsvp, /registry and /directions exist only
# in the browser. Without this line the edge looks for a FILE at that path,
# does not find one, and returns 404 — so a pasted link or a refresh on any
# page but the home page shows an error instead of the site.
#
# Vite copies public/ to the root of dist/, which is where Pages expects it.
# The 200 (not 301) is what makes the URL stay put while index.html is served.

/*    /index.html   200
